軍。時徐州刺史薛安都同逆，上即還道固本號為徐州代之。道固不受命，遣子景微、軍主傅靈越率眾赴安都。既而為土人起義所攻，屢戰失利，閉門自守。會四方平定，上遣使宣慰，道固奉詔歸順。先是與沈文秀共引虜，虜既至，固守距之，因被圍逼。虜每進，輒為道固所摧。三年，以為都督冀青兗幽并五州諸軍事、前將軍、冀州刺史，加節，又進號平北將軍。其年，為虜所陷，被送桑乾，死於虜中。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0046"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-song088-daogu-16:a","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002","start":42,"end":46,"surface":"徐州刺史","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:m0046","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本傳在此用以指明具名人物。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:r0137","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001","start":137,"end":139,"surface":"薛公","person_id":"u3k_51j_4ul_A","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"薛公舉兵淮北","note":"靈越回答劉勔，追述薛安都在淮北舉兵。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue","book_id":"b-songshu-088","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-088-fulingyue-ws2069210"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002:r0063","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-088-song88:p002","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"之","person_id":"u3k_51j_4ul_A","referent_role":"third_person","reference_type":"third_person","quote":"為徐州代之","note":"徐州刺史薛安都為被代者。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-088-song88","book_id":"b-songshu-088","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-088-song88-ws2069210"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p003","text":"宋明帝立，徐州刺史薛安都與道固等立廢帝子業弟子勳，敗乃歸魏。獻文帝以為南冀州刺史、清河公。宋明帝遣說道固，以為徐州刺史，復歸宋。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p003:m0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"薛安都","kind":"person","person_id":"u3k_51j_4ul_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p003:m0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p003:m0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"子業","kind":"person","person_id":"iwn_c2g_zvh","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p003:m0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"子勳","kind":"person","person_id":"902_55f_656","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p003:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"}],"source_position":{"revision_id":2183262,"raw_start":12895,"raw_end":12959,"first_line":150,"last_line":150,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_character_offsets":[12895,12896,12897,12898,12899,12900,12901,12902,12903,12904,12905,12906,12907,12908,12909,12910,12911,12912,12913,12914,12915,12916,12917,12918,12919,12920,12921,12922,12923,12924,12925,12926,12927,12928,12929,12930,12931,12932,12933,12934,12935,12936,12937,12938,12939,12940,12941,12942,12943,12944,12945,12946,12947,12948,12949,12950,12951,12952,12953,12954,12955,12956,12957,12958],"projection_sha256":"de0d3c7a785eea9a09d736a92657c1e0b7e1e8bfc655480f49f8b8329c1ded6f"},"chapter_id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu","book_id":"b-beishi-044","work_id":"w-beishi","source_id":"s-beishi-044-cuidaogu-ws2183262"},{"id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p005","text":"初，道固之在客邸，與薛安都、畢眾敬鄰館，時以公集相見。本既同由武達，頗結寮舊。時安都志已衰朽，於道固疏略，而眾敬每盡殷勤。道固謂劉休賓、房法壽曰：「古人云：「非我族類，其心必異」，安都視人，殊自蕭索，畢固依依也。」景徽字文睿，卒于平州刺史，諡曰定。子休纂襲爵。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-beishi-044-cuidaogu:p005:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"