4-cuidaogu:p006","text":"初，道固之在客邸，與薛安都畢眾敬隣館，時以朝集相見，本既同由武達，頗結僚舊。時安都志已衰朽，於道固情乃疏略，而眾敬每盡殷勤。道固謂劉休賓、房法壽曰：「古人云『非我族類，其心必異』，信不虛也。安都視人殊自蕭索，畢捺固依依也。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p006:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p006:m0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"薛安都","kind":"person","person_id":"u3k_51j_4ul_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p006:m0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"畢眾敬","kind":"person","person_id":"cuc_acf_nlb","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p006:m0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"安都","kind":"person","person_id":"u3k_51j_4ul_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p006:m0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p006:m0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"眾敬","kind":"person","person_id":"cuc_acf_nlb","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p006:m0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p006:m0065","start":65,"end":68,"surface":"劉休賓","kind":"person","person_id":"hxp_qbf_0mu","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p006: